            <p>Our website links to our company page on LinkedIn. The provider is LinkedIn Ireland Unlimited Company, Wilton Plaza, Wilton Place, Dublin 2, Ireland. We would like to point out that you use these external pages and their functions on your own responsibility. When you visit our LinkedIn page, LinkedIn collects your IP address and other information. For information on what data is processed by LinkedIn and for what purposes it is used, please refer to LinkedIn's privacy policy: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.linkedin.com/legal/privacy-policy</a>.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl">6. Your Rights as a Data Subject</h2>
